item.description:
 &lt;p&gt;People in Shenzhen can call the numbers below to check social security and housing fund information — for example, withdrawing from the housing provident fund, loans, the reimbursement ratio for medical insurance, how to get maternity insurance and the benefits it gives you, how to make up missed social security payments, how to transfer your social security after changing jobs, and so on. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shenzhen Social Security Bureau free consultation hotline:&lt;/strong&gt; 0755-96888, 12333 &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You can also call this to apply for or check a child’s medical insurance card:&lt;/strong&gt; 96888 (Remember: a query needs the person’s ID card or social security number; it’s best to go to your local social security bureau and apply for the query there, and you’ll get a satisfactory result.) &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Housing provident fund**&lt;/strong&gt;:** 12329 Questions about settling in Shenzhen, residence permits, ID cards, driving licences, travel permits, entry and exit, tracing people and relatives, lost and found items, case enquiries and so on. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shenzhen Municipal Public Security Bureau:&lt;/strong&gt; 0755—84463999, 25572114, 25576355 Address: 4016 Jiefang Road, Luohu District, Shenzhen &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Public Security Bureau Futian District Sub-bureau:&lt;/strong&gt; 0755-82923357, 84461070 Address: 1st floor, Administrative Service Centre of the Futian Public Security Sub-bureau, Building 106, Jindi Industrial Zone, Futian District, Shenzhen &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Public Security Bureau Luohu District Sub-bureau:&lt;/strong&gt; 0755-84460482, 25777777 Address: 2nd floor, 2000 Hubei Road, Luohu District, Shenzhen &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Public Security Bureau Nanshan District Sub-bureau:&lt;/strong&gt; 0755-84466523, 26610013 Address: Population Management Section, Nanshan Public Security Sub-bureau, 3020 Nanshan Avenue, Nanshan District, Shenzhen &lt;strong&gt;Public Security Bureau Bao’an District Sub-bureau**&lt;/strong&gt;:** 0755-85131409, 27788047 Address: Comprehensive Permit Service Hall, 2 Luotian Road, Xin’an Subdistrict, Bao’an District, Shenzhen &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Public Security Bureau Longgang District Sub-bureau**&lt;/strong&gt;:** 0755-84468230, 28916666 Address: 115 Jihua Road, Buji Subdistrict, Longgang District &lt;/li&gt;
