&lt;p&gt;Rights protection complaints&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All kinds of rights protection complaints. Getting ripped off eating in a restaurant; buying counterfeit or shoddy goods in a small shop; a street vendor driving up prices and charging you extra; getting ripped off buying souvenirs or eating while travelling, or being forced to buy something; ear-splitting noise from a construction site, square dancing that’s too loud, a bar that’s too noisy, and so on.&lt;/p&gt;
